      "description": "Alkaline pre-treatment: The pH of the granular sludge was adjusted to 12.0 ± 0.1 with 3 N NaOH and maintained for 24 hours. This alkaline pre-treatment was applied to enrich hydrogen-producing bacteria and inhibit hydrogen-consuming populations."
    },
